WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.900
Every morning, a wheat farmer
checks one number on her phone:

2
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.720
today's price. She didn't set it.

3
00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:10.180
Neither did her neighbors, or
the grain buyer down the road.

4
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:14.880
In 2022 it averaged about
430 dollars per metric ton,

5
00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:18.140
up from about 315 the year before.

6
00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:21.200
So why can't one wheat
farmer charge even slightly

7
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.100
more than the market price?

8
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:27.960
In this mission, you'll draw the demand
curve that one farm actually faces.

9
00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:31.490
Then you'll decide when a farm
losing money should keep going,

10
00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:33.460
and when it should shut down.

11
00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:37.070
Your mission: find out who
really sets the price of wheat.
